{"id":"f2895e14ad640cde","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-geometric-formula-inverse-image-invariance.md","title":"Theorem — 几何公式的逆像不变性","display":"Theorem — 几何公式的逆像不变性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-geometric-formula-inverse-image-invariance","aliases":["14-thm-geometric-formula-inverse-image-invariance"],"display":"Theorem — 几何公式的逆像不变性","depends_on":["[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","[[14-df-finitary-geometric-formula]]","[[14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics]]","[[14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures]]","[[14-df-subobject-quantifiers]]","[[14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects]]","[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-geometric-formula-inverse-image-invariance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-geometric-formula-inverse-image-invariance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 几何公式的逆像不变性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"99e83f097dc38c76\" href=\"?note=99e83f097dc38c76\" title=\"14-df-finitary-geometric-formula\">14-df-finitary-geometric-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c22badb838a7fca1\" href=\"?note=c22badb838a7fca1\" title=\"14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics\">14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"86c3a123f8ca1262\" href=\"?note=86c3a123f8ca1262\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures\">14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0b6a2f7cb930ac02\" href=\"?note=0b6a2f7cb930ac02\" title=\"14-df-subobject-quantifiers\">14-df-subobject-quantifiers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0a94cb99ec341b7c\" href=\"?note=0a94cb99ec341b7c\" title=\"14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects\">14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b51ff4f43221971d\" href=\"?note=b51ff4f43221971d\" title=\"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image\">14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a> 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\)</span>，上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span> 包含所有自由变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:f^*M_{\\vec x}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}(f^*M)_{\\vec x}\">\\(c:f^*M_{\\vec x}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}(f^*M)_{\\vec x}\\)</span> 为有限乘积比较同构。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 是满足各坐标方程 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i^{\\mathrm{Inv}_f(M)}\\circ c=f^*(\\pi_i^M)\">\\(\\pi_i^{\\mathrm{Inv}_f(M)}\\circ c=f^*(\\pi_i^M)\\)</span> 的唯一有限积比较箭头；空上下文时为到指定终对象的唯一箭头。它由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^*\">\\(f^*\\)</span> 保有限极限而可逆。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^*\">\\(f^*\\)</span> 在子对象上的作用特指 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0a94cb99ec341b7c\" href=\"?note=0a94cb99ec341b7c\" title=\"14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects\">14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_{M_{\\vec x}}\">\\(f_{M_{\\vec x}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c^{-1}\">\\(c^{-1}\\)</span> 在本条表示 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b51ff4f43221971d\" href=\"?note=b51ff4f43221971d\" title=\"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image\">14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image</a> 的子对象逆像。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c^{-1}\\bigl(⟦\\varphi⟧_{\\mathrm{Inv}_f(M),\\vec x}\\bigr)=f_{M_{\\vec x}}\\bigl(⟦\\varphi⟧_{M,\\vec x}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c^{-1}\\bigl(⟦\\varphi⟧_{\\mathrm{Inv}_f(M),\\vec x}\\bigr)=f_{M_{\\vec x}}\\bigl(⟦\\varphi⟧_{M,\\vec x}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>精确来源：原书 X.3 Theorem 5，印刷 p.537。按有限几何公式归纳：原子由有限极限保持，有限析取由有限余积和像保持，存在由像构造保持。公式在不同上下文对象上的子对象只能经规范比较同构后比较，旧稿裸等号省略了这一步。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-finitary-geometric-formula","status":"resolved","id":"99e83f097dc38c76","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-finitary-geometric-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"c22badb838a7fca1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures","status":"resolved","id":"86c3a123f8ca1262","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-quantifiers","status":"resolved","id":"0b6a2f7cb930ac02","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-quantifiers]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects","status":"resolved","id":"0a94cb99ec341b7c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image","status":"resolved","id":"b51ff4f43221971d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects","status":"resolved","id":"0a94cb99ec341b7c","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$c$ 是满足各坐标方程 $\\pi_i^{\\mathrm{Inv}_f(M)}\\circ c=f^*(\\pi_i^M)$ 的唯一有限积比较箭头；空上下文时为到指定终对象的唯一箭头。它由 $f^*$ 保有限极限而可逆。$f^*$ 在子对象上的作用特指 [[14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects]] 的 $f_{M_{\\vec x}}$，$c^{-1}$ 在本条表示 [[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]] 的子对象逆像。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image","status":"resolved","id":"b51ff4f43221971d","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$c$ 是满足各坐标方程 $\\pi_i^{\\mathrm{Inv}_f(M)}\\circ c=f^*(\\pi_i^M)$ 的唯一有限积比较箭头；空上下文时为到指定终对象的唯一箭头。它由 $f^*$ 保有限极限而可逆。$f^*$ 在子对象上的作用特指 [[14-df-geometric-inverse-image-on-subobjects]] 的 $f_{M_{\\vec x}}$，$c^{-1}$ 在本条表示 [[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]] 的子对象逆像。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"c:f^*M_{\\vec x}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}(f^*M)_{\\vec x}","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_i^{\\mathrm{Inv}_f(M)}\\circ c=f^*(\\pi_i^M)","display":false},{"tex":"f^*","display":false},{"tex":"f^*","display":false},{"tex":"f_{M_{\\vec x}}","display":false},{"tex":"c^{-1}","display":false},{"tex":"c^{-1}\\bigl(⟦\\varphi⟧_{\\mathrm{Inv}_f(M),\\vec x}\\bigr)=f_{M_{\\vec x}}\\bigl(⟦\\varphi⟧_{M,\\vec x}\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1856,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-208","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-geometric-formula-inverse-image-invariance|Theorem — 几何公式的逆像不变性]]"},{"id":"a76b2bc2c7b718cf","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"评价函子各式对每个 $\\mathcal U$-Grothendieck 拓扑斯 $\\mathcal B,\\mathcal E$ 及每个 $M\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal B))$ 定义。$\\mathrm{Inv}_f(M)$ 是 [[14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures]] 通过有限积比较同构运输的逆像结构；[[14-thm-geometric-inverse-image-preserves-models]]、[[14-thm-geometric-formula-inverse-image-invariance]] 保证其模型性质。$E_0^{\\mathcal E,M}$ 的定义域是 $\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B))$；$E_1^{\\mathcal E,M}$ 的定义域是该范畴的箭头集，其中每个箭头编码为 $(f,g,\\alpha)$。"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-geometric-formula-inverse-image-invariance]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-209","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-geometric-formula-inverse-image-invariance|Theorem — 几何公式的逆像不变性]]"},{"id":"390383982043afea","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"证明：对 [[14-df-finitary-geometric-formula]] 的有限阶段 n 归纳得 G_S^n⊆P，再取并；反向包含为假设。旧稿仅重复成员资格定义，现提供真正用于 [[14-thm-geometric-formula-inverse-image-invariance]] 等证明的构造归纳原理。"},{"id":"6f0a11402a38ca6b","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"原书 X.3 Corollary 6，印刷 p.537。[[14-thm-geometric-formula-inverse-image-invariance]] 给出每个几何公式子对象的拉回等式；逆像保持包含，故每条理论序列在 f*M 中成立。只需有限余极限及像保持，无需 F、E 为 Grothendieck。"}],"outgoing":["9752b779c5f463f9","99e83f097dc38c76","c22badb838a7fca1","86c3a123f8ca1262","0b6a2f7cb930ac02","0a94cb99ec341b7c","b51ff4f43221971d"]}